{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4d8d5078911849bff741000ca53b5972e6cb1aada835e52e9ba466204e4faa2",
      "text": "Then how about this!? A new sweet\nthat packs in everything girls love:\nthe Canele Tapioca Maritozzo Crepe!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62d08018325f659faf9c3f6f418b3ba1ede320002c1004f0ebb7be165e379f13",
      "text": "Rejected.\nImpossible.\nA three-year-old's idea.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b71e4a572a7cd72302914ffc6edc44b032c927073501bed5e020b782ce21fc4",
      "text": "W-why!?\nIt's the result of listening to the\npeople!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:14b96aa62dbcab0753f0e6fcd6b66fddf6f7aefcb111ccd737aab2116642bc9b",
      "text": "Ha ha. I'd like to try it, myself.\nDoesn't it sound fun?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:614096a6ad6d9c51f958d4fc560e82138fdd46ec67a9d36643fec79022d2bde7",
      "text": "Hmm... It may appeal to men, but\nright now that's not the point—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:629d4cdc47e6eb8f60184a717f69814f6546067aaf8b45978d7634ae4de83d29",
      "text": "Oh, Alk and Shota!\nI'd like your opinions too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2e6cfed4baf14efbf9553b216029b31758426845a18c36d1f21938bd8371a61d",
      "text": "What's up? More work talk? Like,\nwhat sweets might sell?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:55d297c168ab54f9a2da99d5520f6dc194ffc339edfc9f4c9edd55962da739a7",
      "text": "That talk is tempting, but right now\nI'm headed in a different direction.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e16345364dbc08a51b253dfc765c865770cc5c4e4eab39e5017b9d8778fc312",
      "text": "I am agonizing fiercely. Over gifts\nfor the ladies, for 'White Day'!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:239f3a01717d392af14c9510391439ac9abb3a6e3f475f6107309278c36c2f5b",
      "text": "The ladies, plural...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf258ec7e63de7f365175d6e57823f760d2a6706632c0e69c1515ebe54929d20",
      "text": "Well, returning what I got at\nValentine's Fest is no trouble.\nI got about as much last year!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:27067562685d5ec421eecf269b337a0a9f1ea5390aa11ce442fb9bcadafbc491",
      "text": "But this year, the women of Shibuya\nalso gave me chocolate! Oh, a\nhandsome face is such a burden!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0fe36c809dff130f7a488f8bc3cb1b80cbd53e220e63abc3220c2efc7212d417",
      "text": "And in Shibuya, you return triple on\nWhite Day, don't you? There's nothing\nfor it but to give it my all!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0b7d4ec37daf76fc3a7aadc802d85f6a664029ea5eea954b0a55e72ba806c49c",
      "text": "So I'd love to hear from you two,\nwho come from Shibuya!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e9bfce6cc74ae661d512a2352a720bac04d5a9f1dd05b0be28caa4349518533",
      "text": "Don't worry, I have plenty\nof money! Don't mind the\ncost and speak freely—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e410096f10d46f5ab142b75d0e0e73cb7e7f6e18cbae1e4d89e2163d1b5d3f24",
      "text": "Ah!! What are you doing!\nMy honey cheese tart!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:afb7a7f3c79351391168595f1056feaf148ef3ed5b3de1a244e86a07df216e43",
      "text": "Shut uuuuup. Is this bragging?\nI seriously can't forgive this???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2e9ace8476906bee97b8f3f304330597008ee3264319f52f2c1faf863f9f8bde",
      "text": "W-why!? If you're cold to me,\nI'll cry! Should I apologize\nfor my face being too good!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bc39ef85b83e8a55fcbac02139abbe25d05d6c81a3c5d2d0f154c7d243758c27",
      "text": "Come on, you said work was busy.\nSo you were just wrapped up in\nromance after all?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ca1f2709c18c6f76fdd3d7329b2dbb36c3af422e5e453c89450aa96cae7cd86b",
      "text": "N-no, Shota! This is\nproper work, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5490c75550e92310bf824307bfa8ebeee010d35d43d4295179fe81704d71ec66",
      "text": "Networking and market research! I'm\nstudying what Shibuya women want in\nsweets to plan our market strategy—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2c9d3dd8fb748b8d27d56d6f4aab9a7ea714da89a2923e7a991dedc5fc9c8c85",
      "text": "But you do know you're popular,\ndon't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7a7a2e35ba02c9289b14ad4b1691c3cd34d35bde0e3d6069a1db3df77ee0bd3f",
      "text": "W-well... I'm happy for the feelings.\nEven if I know they just see my face\nand status and get the wrong idea!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58373c4416ae5aeb783a911390be5318617abd9e7a3082cc86c1d0f229f0907b",
      "text": "Is his self-image high or low?\nI can't tell at all...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0159eeaa309ab5348ccb762ab39b83e9b4d2df79824f054a95cafa6dbdfd9d07",
      "text": "Then why not try dating, work aside?\nYou don't mind it, do you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8579bbca7cbcb90810ad8ccc56f6134c22d016b3f8e29b8cffdd6cb126882ff9",
      "text": "Uh... no... hmm...\nIt's just, well... They are all\ncertainly lovely and charming, but...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33415a5997367f0a75fbba1200f6eb220e5b0f47b49831c30b9ed4df471792f4",
      "text": "I see?\nRight, so you do find them charming?\nAnd then? And then???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:017b233efb88663e21bafb99eaece64445972841416c9cf015de88539602c98c",
      "text": "I fall apart.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:25ad7a851017be3da26c0887425f36581db7381df87a9e2f14f70d463faced38",
      "text": "Fall apart...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:af376beb0f78edd21d12ffc4e7815d43c4f287b2d62bfa63e17e1333edb0a44b",
      "text": "Once I fall for someone, I give it\nmy all. Then everything else falls\napart! That's me! Awful, I know...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d93796324b00a013ee68bc039098d8cb8a33c1a37d684b23509788587946a51d",
      "text": "Think about it! Do you really believe\nI'm someone who can balance work\nand romance!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8bb334d235889aff7ada92f620d10265eda116001251a18b706776a360bf6a53",
      "text": "Ha. Of course not!\nI'm even worse at it!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:277e11b068113db4bde249ca631cd83f21e99a1ddecdb2786b74a03712a78d96",
      "text": "Why are you both proudly announcing\nyour weak points???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fdb5d7597738f6dfc700311170c9c20b678f4a2db16d6f746d9900b49dd4336c",
      "text": "Hmm............ I see~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e696a47f9848cce73518dc026a872c6c770a64fcda1eb836d427ba4f20a1fdc5",
      "text": "To begin with, aren't you both\nbadly mistaken?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:81d6c7b072af2ca271b4cffdbcfba9b9b36142ea6f5465dfba45fd284a3b2213",
      "text": "I'm busy chasing my ideal! As a\nSwes, I will make trade between the\nFarlands and Palpebra flourish...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:550d5d3e2537090d095e79bd3413130fe08991e3210ae78eb41532a720a1a650",
      "text": "Also! If I had time off, I'd want to\nplay with you guys more!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ec489aec18001e004d0339c5430c47a5b892f6b2e8423748e703f2738d1d613",
      "text": "I'm incredibly jealous you go out to\nhave fun!! When I have time, I'm\ndefinitely joining you!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7c4d0bdd61b35b05d0bd59ab9abab0e9f8f16567055519fe7837825133b9b3e",
      "text": "U-uh, okay...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a51bd1efaf81cd83975497a51146ee177c888b6fe1b16c618461689921d4b101",
      "text": "Ha ha. You're both so popular, Alk\nand Shota.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c582cd3b3ac78eb8989f57d28a9053be6852bda833bdf2fb122780d6725f6584",
      "text": "What are you saying? I want to play\nwith Nova too! With all my heart!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c273cc230e89f50d830f3942c8595a511eef88ef8fa068d0c3de90170f1cdc7d",
      "text": "Really?\nSo I'm popular too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bca6b1cc566b86993a858fdc755230d3ab13224c1944979bc23be129bf7cbbeb",
      "text": "Whoa... what is this conversation...\nIs it just me or is this itchy...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:28a4cce3a10d72933abfdb3f67684f1ccc69b80f26eabdea9991809ae74b2fc5",
      "text": "You may laugh, Alk, but I want to\nmove forward with you as business\npartners, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f9d971f0490bc4e204b00da3f847cc56e12e83c169e7dc589c1b3cfb6a105b4",
      "text": "Huh? Business?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b70ce1587c7285f3cb2fa3ba35937b4051b12aad8d5c7edf4d798f30859c1fac",
      "text": "Investment! I haven't given up on\ninvesting in Starview Village, and in\nyou all!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8070b91c94428caeeea0f01732442e3fe9c0348388bf785ca8adc23bc95eb8fb",
      "text": "Oh... right. You did talk about that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7c74812ef1265a9bb16bea756f6d34af500b315be9f398360313922bc29223e",
      "text": "The Purgers are scary, but I won't\nlose the friends I've finally made!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b27dc544eb3f57f9a30b77dce0d7b1efec84de59bdd23eebe4aff0f932933105",
      "text": "If you need funds, just say the word.\nDon't worry, I have plenty of money!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8867447f5bd450335c772eee8515bd90901d1fcd97d62d8499dcda223b0c6dc7",
      "text": "Ha ha... yes, yes, thank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6cdcf43d2097079baca8936c2154e2cf2d84aad0dae80b826b990ae3fec0713",
      "text": "There you go dodging again! I'm\nserious about—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:48ba7f6f86bdca9437b875e94620284fe1f4e2e9d431f810db8b1a3f2794fa1b",
      "text": "Yeah, I know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "223": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:608688a6f2f64443694530c438bbb1cdd81d60f83188ab5d1c9ec834276860d0",
      "text": "That's why I'll definitely talk to\nStella about it later.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e8c16ee68f258e5b037b40e99843b2e09bad86abc3aed5b38e5246d3b3a5b94c",
      "text": "Heh heh heh... I see, I see!\nAh, at last I can do official\nbusiness with this town!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0baf81a0156b29b8c9c6e7bdaab8f2ea3a6d9a67fe66a8bbc0bf3bc30b6fd9ef",
      "text": "You seem especially happy about\nthis, though?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f57fbd1995749838191a6b6292a5b0e87a7f859efd46f014d2a9e598229e15a",
      "text": "Of course! I can finally support you\nwith my weapons!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "238": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c0e98095dcb009d7493daf86759a067bbf1099407ad4b4d6212faa1a51b8e3b",
      "text": "Listen up, gentlemen! From now on\nI'll support you with all I have!\nUpon the name of Libram Swes!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a024a91325e2975a650c1c8306c4fc70e4c4101a3e83a7efd2b74a06fb82a59c",
      "text": "Ha ha ha ha ha ha!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
